{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify pricing comparison section that closely matches the attached reference image.
    
    LAYOUT
    - White background with a centered container, maximum width 1400px.
    - Desktop: three equal-width pricing cards in one row with 18–20px gaps.
    - Generous spacing above the cards and 40px horizontal section padding.
    - Mobile: stack the cards vertically, use 20px side padding, and prevent horizontal overflow.
    
    SECTION HEADER
    - Small uppercase eyebrow with a blue dot: “SHOPIFY WEBSITE PACKAGES”. Use wide letter spacing.
    - Large, left-aligned headline on two lines:
      “Your next chapter.”
      “Built on Shopify.”
    - First line: dark charcoal, regular sans-serif.
    - Second line: bright orange #FF7014, italic sans-serif.
    - Desktop heading approximately 64px; mobile approximately 38px.
    - Add a thin light-gray divider below the heading.
    - Below the divider, place a light-gray rounded pill on the left: “One-time project pricing”.
    - Right-align this small note: “All prices in USD · No monthly agency commitment”.
    - On mobile, allow these elements to wrap naturally.
    
    PRICING CARD DESIGN
    - Equal-height cards with approximately 28px internal padding and 8px corner radius.
    - Launch and Scale: very light gray background #F5F7F5, thin gray border, dark text.
    - Growth: dark charcoal-green background #20271F, white body text, orange accents.
    - Use a clean sans-serif for body text and prices. Use a bold editorial serif for plan names.
    - Align prices, buttons, dividers, and feature lists consistently across all cards.
    - Place delivery estimates at the bottom using a flex column layout.
    - Each button spans the card width, with its label on the left and an up-right arrow on the right.
    - Launch and Scale buttons: white background, thin dark border, dark text.
    - Growth button: solid orange background with dark text.
    - Separate each button from its features with a thin horizontal divider.
    - Features use small checkmarks: blue on light cards, orange on the dark card.
    - Keep typography compact and readable, matching the reference’s hierarchy.
    - Ensure all text has readable contrast on the highlighted card.
    
    CARD 1
    Eyebrow: “01 / START STRONG”
    Plan: “Launch”
    Description: “A professional first store, without the complexity.”
    Price: “$1,000”
    Price note: “USD · One-time investment”
    Button: “Choose Launch”
    Feature heading: “YOUR LAUNCH ESSENTIALS”
    Features:
    - Premium theme installed & branded
    - Up to 25 products loaded
    - Home, About, Contact + 1 policy page
    - Payments, shipping, taxes & domain
    - 1 app installed & configured
    - Basic SEO & notification emails
    - Mobile responsiveness check
    - Recorded training walkthrough
    - 1 revision round · 7 days of support
    Delivery: “Estimated delivery: 1–2 weeks”
    
    CARD 2
    Eyebrow: “02 / BUILD MOMENTUM”
    Add an orange pill badge at the top right: “THE GROWTH PICK”
    Plan: “Growth”
    Description: “A tailored store for brands ready to go further.”
    Price: “$3,000”
    Price note: “USD · One-time investment”
    Button: “Choose Growth”
    Feature heading: “A MORE TAILORED FOUNDATION”
    Features:
    - 30-minute strategy call
    - Tailored home, collection & product templates
    - Up to 150 products · up to 8 pages
    - Full setup, discounts & market settings
    - Up to 3 apps installed & configured
    - Klaviyo welcome & abandoned cart flows
    - On-page SEO, redirects & sitemap
    - Basic product & customer migration
    - Mobile & speed optimization
    - Recorded training · 2 revision rounds
    Delivery: “Estimated delivery: 3–5 weeks”
    
    CARD 3
    Eyebrow: “03 / THINK BIGGER”
    Plan: “Scale”
    Description: “A bespoke experience for your next stage of growth.”
    Price: “$10,000”
    Price note: “USD · One-time investment”
    Button: “Choose Scale”
    Feature heading: “A FULLY CUSTOM FOUNDATION”
    Features:
    - Discovery & competitor review
    - Custom wireframes, UI & bespoke sections
    - Unlimited bulk product import · 20+ pages
    - Multi-market & advanced store setup
    - Up to 8 apps + custom integrations
    - Full Klaviyo flows, analytics & tracking
    - Technical SEO, schema & redirect mapping
    - Product, customer & order migration
    - Performance tuning & CRO review
    - Training · 3 revision rounds
    - Dedicated PM · 60 days of support
    Delivery: “Estimated delivery: 8–12 weeks”
    
    BOTTOM NOTE
    Below the cards, display a centered, small disclaimer:
    “Shopify subscriptions, paid themes, and third-party app charges should be confirmed separately before your project begins.”
    
    THEME EDITOR CONTROLS
    - Build this as one reusable section with editable pricing-card blocks.
    - Allow editing of all headings, descriptions, prices, price notes, badge text, button labels, button links, features, and delivery estimates.
    - Features should be entered as multiline text, with each line rendered as one checked item.
    - Include a highlighted-card toggle and optional badge for each card.
    - Expose section width, desktop/mobile padding, card gap, colors, typography, and separate desktop/mobile font sizes.
    - Use the theme’s font pickers for heading, plan-name, and body fonts.
    - Use semantic HTML, accessible links, and scoped CSS.
    - No imag
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
  {{ block.settings.heading_font | font_face }}
  {{ block.settings.plan_font | font_face }}
  {{ block.settings.body_font | font_face }}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;padding:{{ block.settings.pad_desktop }}px 20px;background:{{ block.settings.bg }};color:{{ block.settings.ink }};box-sizing:border-box}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{max-width:1400px;width:100%;margin:auto}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{font:600 11px/1.4 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 18px}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.dot }};margin-right:9px}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font:400 {{ block.settings.head_desktop }}px/1.03 {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }},sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title em{font-style:italic;color:{{ block.settings.orange }}}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-top:28px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid {{ block.settings.rule }}}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill{background:{{ block.settings.pill }};border-radius:30px;padding:8px 14px;font:500 12px/1.3 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__note{font:400 12px/1.5 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;text-align:right;margin:0}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:{{ block.settings.gap }}px;margin-top:48px;align-items:stretch}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:28px;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.border }};border-radius:8px;background:{{ block.settings.card_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.card_ink }}}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--highlight{background:{{ block.settings.dark_bg }};border-color:{{ block.settings.dark_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.dark_ink }}}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow-card{font:600 10px/1.4 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;letter-spacing:.13em;color:{{ block.settings.muted }};margin:0}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--highlight .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow-card{color:{{ block.settings.dark_muted }}}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{padding:6px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:{{ block.settings.orange }};color:#20271f;font:700 9px/1.2 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__plan{font:700 30px/1.1 {{ block.settings.plan_font.family }},serif;margin:20px 0 7px}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc{font:400 13px/1.55 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;margin:0;min-height:42px}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price{font:600 37px/1.1 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:24px 0 3px}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price-note{font:400 11px/1.5 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;color:{{ block.settings.muted }};margin:0}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--highlight .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price-note{color:{{ block.settings.dark_muted }}}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:13px 14px;margin-top:22px;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.ink }};border-radius:4px;background:#fff;color:{{ block.settings.ink }};font:600 12px/1.3 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;text-decoration:none}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--highlight .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button{background:{{ block.settings.orange }};border-color:{{ block.settings.orange }};color:#20271f}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid {{ block.settings.orange }};outline-offset:3px}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__features{margin-top:19px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid {{ block.settings.border }}}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--highlight .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__features{border-color:{{ block.settings.dark_rule }}}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-title{font:700 9px/1.4 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;letter-spacing:.13em;margin:0 0 13px}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list li{display:flex;gap:9px;margin:0 0 9px;font:400 11px/1.45 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__check{color:{{ block.settings.blue }};font-weight:700;flex:0 0 auto}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--highlight .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__check{color:{{ block.settings.orange }}}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__delivery{font:500 10px/1.5 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;color:{{ block.settings.muted }};margin:auto 0 0;padding-top:19px}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--highlight .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__delivery{color:{{ block.settings.dark_muted }}}
  .ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__disclaimer{max-width:760px;margin:25px auto 0;text-align:center;font:400 11px/1.6 {{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;color:{{ block.settings.muted }}}
  @media(max-width:749px){.ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:{{ block.settings.pad_mobile }}px 20px}.ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font-size:{{ block.settings.head_mobile }}px}.ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__meta{flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start}.ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__note{text-align:left}.ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:32px}.ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{padding:24px}.ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc{min-height:0}}
{% endstyle %}
<section class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><header><p class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow"><span class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p><h2 class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ block.settings.line_one | escape }}<br><em>{{ block.settings.line_two | escape }}</em></h2><div class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__meta"><span class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill">{{ block.settings.pill_text | escape }}</span><p class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__note">{{ block.settings.header_note | escape }}</p></div></header><div class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid">{% for i in (1..3) %}{% liquid
assign prefix = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_'
assign eyebrow_key = prefix | append: 'eyebrow'
assign name_key = prefix | append: 'name'
assign desc_key = prefix | append: 'description'
assign price_key = prefix | append: 'price'
assign note_key = prefix | append: 'price_note'
assign label_key = prefix | append: 'button_label'
assign url_key = prefix | append: 'button_url'
assign heading_key = prefix | append: 'feature_heading'
assign features_key = prefix | append: 'features'
assign delivery_key = prefix | append: 'delivery'
assign badge_key = prefix | append: 'badge'
assign highlight_key = prefix | append: 'highlight'
assign feat = block.settings[features_key] | newline_to_br | split: '<br />'
%}<article class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{% if block.settings[highlight_key] %} ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--highlight{% endif %}"><div class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top"><p class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow-card">{{ block.settings[eyebrow_key] | escape }}</p>{% if block.settings[badge_key] != blank %}<span class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">{{ block.settings[badge_key] | escape }}</span>{% endif %}</div><h3 class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__plan">{{ block.settings[name_key] | escape }}</h3><p class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc">{{ block.settings[desc_key] | escape }}</p><p class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{{ block.settings[price_key] | escape }}</p><p class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price-note">{{ block.settings[note_key] | escape }}</p>{% if block.settings[url_key] != blank %}<a class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button" href="{{ block.settings[url_key] }}"><span>{{ block.settings[label_key] | escape }}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% else %}<span class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button"><span>{{ block.settings[label_key] | escape }}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>{% endif %}<div class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__features"><h4 class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-title">{{ block.settings[heading_key] | escape }}</h4><ul class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list">{% for item in feat %}{% assign item_text = item | strip_html | strip %}{% if item_text != blank %}<li><span class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>{{ item_text | escape }}</span></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div><p class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__delivery">{{ block.settings[delivery_key] | escape }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div><p class="ai-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}__disclaimer">{{ block.settings.disclaimer | escape }}</p></div></section>
{% schema %}
